course: dictionary
lesson: 12254
title: Consult: ask or look it up
level: primary-4
stars: 0
explain: Consult is a verb. It means to go to someone or something to get advice or information. «I will consult a dictionary when I am not sure how to spell a word.» Here you look in a book to find the answer.
explain: You can also consult a person. «Ella will consult her mum before she decides.» Ella asks her mum for advice first, and then she chooses. The word before tells you that the asking comes first.
explain: Use the words around consult to check its meaning. «Please consult a doctor if you feel ill.» Feeling ill is the clue: a doctor is the person to ask for help. Try swapping in ask or look at: if the sentence still makes sense, you have the right meaning.
fact: Consult means to go to someone or something for advice or information.
fact: You can consult a book, a map or a dictionary to find information.
fact: You can consult a person, such as a doctor, a pharmacist or a teacher.
fact: Consult can also mean to talk with others before you make a decision.
fact: Consult is a verb, so it changes: consults, consulted and consulting.
exercise: «I will consult a dictionary to check the spelling.» What does consult mean here? | Read it aloud to a friend | Throw the book away | Write a new book | *Look in a book for information
exercise: Who can you consult when you feel ill? | A pencil case | *A doctor | A pet fish | A football
exercise: Which word means nearly the same as consult? | Hurry | *Ask for advice | Forget | Ignore
test: «Please consult the table to find the answer.» What should you do with the table? | Paint it | Eat it | *Look at it for information | Move it away
test: «Dad will consult his map before we drive to the coast.» What does Dad do with the map? | Goes to sleep on it | *Looks at it to find the way | Sings a song with it | Buys a new car with it
exam: «Before she chose a pet, Maya consulted her parents.» What did Maya do? | She bought a pet at once | *She asked them for advice before deciding | She ignored them | She lost her pet
